      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF-09 Notification API\n`POST /webhook/ops/notify` (header auth, backend only).\n\n### Body\n- `dedupe_key`, `template_key`, `recipient`, `subject`, `html`\n- optional `entity_type`, `entity_id`, `application_id`\n\nThe message goes through **SWF-02**: recorded in `ops.notifications`, sent at most once per dedupe key, with the same mail credential as every other email. Used for staff sign-in links.",
